t. It may be prepared with different ingredients. Vegetarian cabbage soup may use mushroom stock. Another variety is using a fish stock. There is also a preference to cook cabbage soup using a pork stock."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-cabbage-soup"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cabbage_soup"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Polish cuisine","cuisine/polish-cuisine"],["Russian cuisine","cuisine/russian-cuisine"],["Ukrainian cuisine","cuisine/ukrainian-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":4,"links":[["Brassica oleracea","ingredient/brassica-oleracea"],["Broth","ingredient/broth"],["Cabbage","ingredient/cabbage"],["Sauerkraut","ingredient/sauerkraut"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Polonist","ref":"site/polonist-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"polonist.com","note":"Polish recipes and food culture from a Polish-born writer living abroad.","url":"https://www.polonist.com/about/","suggested":true},{"name":"Polish Your Kitchen","ref":"site/polishyourkitchen-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"polishyourkitchen.com","note":"Long-running blog of traditional Polish home recipes.","url":"https://polishyourkitchen.com","suggested":true},{"name":"Olga's Flavor Factory","ref":"site/olgasflavorfactory-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"olgasflavorfactory.com","note":"Russian-born home cook Olga's blog, with a dedicated Russian recipes category.","url":"https://www.olgasflavorfactory.com/category/russianrecipes/","suggested":true},{"name":"Savas Kitchen: Ukrainian recipes","ref":"site/savaskitchen-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"savaskitchen.com","note":"Ukrainian-born home cook Nataliia Savas's section of family Ukrainian recipes.","url":"https://savaskitchen.com/category/ukrainian-recipes","suggested":true}]},{"h":"More from Polish cuisine","links":[["Baba (cake)","dish/baba-cake"],["Bagel","dish/bagel"],["Borscht","dish/borscht"],["Cabbage roll","dish/cabbage-rol