a"],["Chevys Fresh Mex","dish/chevys-fresh-mex"],["Chi-Chi's","dish/chi-chi-s"],["Chico's Tacos","dish/chico-s-tacos"],["Chile con queso","dish/chile-con-queso"],["Chili con carne","dish/chili-con-carne"],["Chimichanga","dish/chimichanga"],["Chiquito (restaurant)","dish/chiquito-restaurant"],["Concha","dish/concha"],["Contramar","dish/contramar"],["Cosecha","dish/cosecha"],["Del Taco","dish/del-taco"],["Discada","dish/discada"],["District Taco","dish/district-taco"],["Don Pablo's","dish/don-pablo-s"],["El Adobe de Capistrano","dish/el-adobe-de-capistrano"],["El Bajío (restaurant)","dish/el-bajio-restaurant"],["El Chico (restaurant)","dish/el-chico-restaurant"],["El Coyote Cafe","dish/el-coyote-cafe"],["El Fenix (restaurant)","dish/el-fenix-restaurant"],["El Gallo Taqueria","dish/el-gallo-taqueria"],["El Tepeyac Café","dish/el-tepeyac-cafe"],["El Torito","dish/el-torito"],["Em (restaurant)","dish/em-restaurant"]]}]},"ingredient/hungarian-sausages":{"t":"ingredient","r":"ingredient/hungarian-sausages","n":"Hungarian sausages","c":"#c9b8dd","crumb":[["Ingredients","ingredients"]],"sub":"Ingredient in 1 dish across 2 cuisines","intro":[["Hungarian sausages are sausages found in the cuisine of Hungary. Hungary produces a vast number of sausage types. They may be boiled, fresh or dried, and smoked, with different spices and flavors, hot or mild. Hungarian cuisine uses different types of sausages in many ways such as in dishes, for example, in stews like paprikás krumpli or in soups such as bean goulash."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"ingredient-hungarian-sausages"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hungarian_sausages"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's cooked with","count":2,"groups":[["Hungarian cuisine","cuisine/hungarian-cuisine",[["Rakott krumpli","dish/rakott-krumpli"]]],["Ukrainian cuisine","cuisine/ukrainian-cuisine",[["Rakott krumpli","dish/rakott-krumpli"]]]]},{"h":"Often cooked with","links":[["Egg","ingredient/egg"],["Pota